    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+, Mark of Passage Feat)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase one ability score of your choice by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Improved Intuition.</strong> When you use the Intuitive Motion benefit of your Mark of Passage feat, you can roll 1d6 instead of 1d4.</p><p><strong>Inspired Passage.</strong> When you use the Magical Passage benefit of your Mark of Passage feat to cast Misty Step without a spell slot, you can also choose up to two willing creatures you can see within 30 feet of you before you teleport. Each of them can then take a Reaction to teleport up to 30 feet to an unoccupied space it can see.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-PqPzh5yx0YXklEj2\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Improved Intuition: change the bonus of the <em>Intuitive Motion</em> effect of your Mark of Passage feat from 1d4 to 1d6.</p></section>",
